# LaTeX build products. report.tex is the single source.
#
# Rebuild with:  cd report && latexmk
# latexmkrc puts report.pdf here, next to report.tex, and the auxiliary
# files in build/.
#
# report.pdf is NOT listed. It is a build product, but it is also one of the
# three deliverables this directory exists to hand over, and a reader without
# XeLaTeX needs it. The root .gitignore tracks it explicitly.
build/
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.xdv
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
# Retired export route (report.md -> .docx -> .pdf), removed 2026-09-01.
*.docx
~$*.docx
